# ISZE GPS — ITUK rules (mandatory)

Read `01_data/91_build/GPS_FILE_LINEAGE.md` before editing any GPS workbook or builder.

## ITUK placement — never “just another DB”

| Artifact | ITUK allowed? |
|----------|----------------|
| **Proposal FY27** (9 kickback DBs, +1.5pp) | **NO** |
| **Other DBs FY27** (Cyprus, Greece, no-UIO, …) | **NO** |
| **ITUK FY27** tab (Target Study walkthrough only) | **YES** |
| **ISZE_GPS_v5.xlsx** (network plan, all DBs) | **YES** — class-weighted wallet |

> User rule: **leave ITUK out** of kickback / other-DB proposal tables. Document on dedicated **ITUK FY27** tab only.

Stretch rule for ITUK: **Target Study +9% dealer sell-out** — not flat +1.5pp kickback.

## Two layers — do not compare totals

| Layer | FY27 example | Currency | Data |
|-------|--------------|----------|------|
| Dealer retail potential (study row 22) | ~£17.65M | **GBP** | Sales **to dealer** |
| ISZE max spend / wallet (study row 36) | ~€13.05M | **EUR** | **ISZE → DB** (ASC billing) |

Row 36 = row 22 × **0.7392** (0.66 GP × 1.12 FX). GPS% denominator = **row 36 EUR only**.

## Per-unit rates (ISZE wallet)

| Class | €/UIO | £ retail |
|-------|-------|----------|
| N35 | **296** | 400 |
| N75/LD | **739** | 1,000 |
| F/MD | **887** | 1,200 |

ITUK UIO buckets: **N35 / N75_LD / F_MD** from DVLA + `4. ITUK UIO Projection` — never generic “CV LD” @ €739 for N35.

Source: `gps_v9_loaders.py` · `build_gps_v5.py` · `build_gps_kickback_proposal.py`.

## Common agent mistakes (avoid)

1. Putting ITUK on **Other DBs** next to small markets — wrong tab.
2. HTML saying “ITUK excluded, no stretch” while workbook applies Target Study stretch — contradictory.
3. Treating **£17M** and **€13M** as the same number in different currencies.
4. Pricing N35 at **€739** (LD rate) in v5 — inflates wallet to ~€18M.
5. Forking **v6** calculator as planning successor — extend **v5** instead.
